F1 score. This metric is the most used member of the parametric family of the F-measures, named after the parameter value β=1. F1 score is defined as the harmonic mean of precision and recall (Table 2) and as a function of M, has the following shape:
4\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
